# /model's speed column: Enter on a level of a model that offers Fast opens
# it with `fast` marked -- previewed on the footer from the levels on -- Down
# to Ultra, Tab, Left back to the levels, a level spelled out and a space;
# the turns sent at Ultra and then, after /fast, at Fast; and the explicit
# form with a speed, refused and applied.
models models.json
gateway speed-turns.json
fx: seed model-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed model-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /model
key Space
wait 0.8
type gpt
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap effort
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap speed-open
key Down
wait 0.3
snap speed-down
key Tab
wait 0.3
snap speed-tab
key Left
wait 0.3
snap speed-left
type high
key Space
wait 0.4
snap speed-space
key Down
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap commit
home after-commit
type say something
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap turn-ultra
type /fast
key Enter
wait 1
snap fast-on
home after-fast
type say more
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap turn-fast
paste /model anthropic/claude-opus-5 high ultrafast
wait 0.6
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap explicit-bad
key C-u
wait 0.3
paste /model openai/gpt-6-astra xhigh fast
wait 0.6
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap explicit-ok
home end
gwlog
